	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance lazily waved his hand.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'It was a joke. Do you think I'
	R
	'would take a man seriously?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'The knight frantically tried'
	R
	'to resist falling to his knees.'
	\L_06bc3:
