	'still hurts...'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'So what is it?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'We captured an enemy general'
	R
	'and need to know what to do'
	R
	'with them.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'If you brought them here to me,'
	R
	'then I assume it isn’t a man?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course, King Rance.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Guess you all understand by'
	R
	'now. Heeheeheehee.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'Naturally... Heeheehee.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'...Uh, ahem. Hey, bring her in!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'The knight’s shout signaled'
	R
	'two soldiers to come in,'
	R
	'carrying a woman between them.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
