	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'...'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Be glad.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b2a:
	ZH 1:
	'I’ve heard that King Rance is'
	R
	'a shell collector.'
	R
	'I’m sure this is very'
	R
	'important to him...'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'This is a fine shell...'
	R
	'I’ll treasure it in my home.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, do whatever you want'
	R
	'with it. I want to talk with'
	R
	'her for a while, have all the'
	R
	'soldiers go outside.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, Your Majesty.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b70:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'The knight respectfully bowed'
	R
	'and led the soldiers outside.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'He sure was happy to get that'
	R
	'shell that was in my soup last'
	R
	'night. Weird guy.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	!VAR0516 : 24!
	\L_06b62:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Anyway, you. What’s your name?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'...Isoroku. Isoroku Yamamoto.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh. I was assuming you'
	R
	'wouldn’t respond, but I guess'
	R
	'you’re pretty obedient.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t like how you talk,'
	R
	'though, it’s pretty rough.'
	R
	'Try to be cuter.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'It doesn’t matter how I talk.'
	R
	'I don’t intend to disgrace'
	R
	'myself. Now behead me.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Isoroku maintained her'
	R
	'fortitude even as a prisoner.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance approached Isoroku.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'W-What are you doing? How rude.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance’s finger ran along'
	R
	'Isoroku’s white nape.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Want me to cut through this'
	R
	'neck...?'
	\L_06bc3:
