	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmm... This neck.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'The feeling of the finger on'
	R
	'her neck disappeared.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b2a:
	ZH 1:
	'...Is this the end of the'
	R
	'Yamamoto family?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Isoroku bit her lip hard.'
	R
	'It wasn’t because she would be'
	R
	'beheaded. It was due to the'
	R
	'end of the Yamamoto bloodline.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Suddenly, the presence of the'
	R
	'person next to her vanished.'
	R
	'Isoroku opened her eyes.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was looking down on'
	R
	'Isoroku from a little ways'
	R
	'away.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it...? Kill me!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'...No. That would be such a'
	R
	'waste. I’m giving you the'
	R
	'special privilege of working'
	R
	'for me.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'Wha...?!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Your subordinates are outside.'
	R
	'Use them to fight under me.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'Y-You bastard! Are you taking'
	R
	'pity on me?!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Isoroku was suddenly furious,'
	R
	'like a fire was ignited inside'
	R
	'her.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m letting you live, why do'
	R
	'you have to be mad?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'You’re taking pity on me'
	R
	'because I’m a woman, aren’t'
	R
	'you?! To me, that is the'
	R
	'greatest insult!'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'If I accept that I will'
	R
	'forever live in disgrace!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Isoroku’s spit flew from her'
	R
	'mouth as she screamed at Rance.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, got no choice then...'
	R
	'If you’re gonna go that far'
