	'Isoroku’s expression changed.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'...What?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'You and your subordinates'
	R
	'outside are all gonna get'
	R
	'executed.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'B-But... You can do what you'
	R
	'like with me, but not them!'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph, what am I supposed to do'
	R
	'with soldiers that have no'
	R
	'general?'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06b0e:
	ZH 1:
	'But some of them have wives'
	R
	'and children! Who will take'
