	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06a9e:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm. That’s cuter.'
	\L_06bc3:
	\L_06bb6:
	\L_06ad6:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance nodded with satisfaction.'
	\L_06bc3:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus, JAPAN’s female general,'
